OL,3,GNEWSANew test diagnoses MS without
OL,4,Aneedle procedure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA test developed in Nottingham is
OL,7,Fhelping to diagnose multiple sclerosis
OL,8,F(MS) without the need for an invasive
OL,9,Flumbar puncture.
OL,11,FExperts at the University of Nottingham
OL,12,F(UoN) found they could successfully
OL,13,Fidentify MS with a new type of MRI
OL,14,Fscan, after more than 20 years of
OL,15,Fresearch.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
