OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1790746022
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSANew test diagnoses MS without
OL,4,Aneedle procedure
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatients being tested for the
OL,7,Fneurological condition - caused when
OL,8,Fthe immune system mistakenly attacks
OL,9,Fnerves in the brain and spinal cord -
OL,10,Fpreviously had to undergo a procedure
OL,11,Finvolving a needle being inserted into
OL,12,Ftheir lower back.
OL,14,FMedical experts behind the test, which
OL,15,Fhas been rolled out in the city, said
OL,16,Fit is faster, cheaper, and they hope it
OL,17,Fwill now be rolled out across the
OL,18,Fcountry.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
